@title 3D heat: the Heat flow layer has a W/m2 key and the through-flow line says how many watts the air carries out
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The hot cabinet with four grilles (qa/fixtures/make_vents_fixtures.py). After the run, Heat flow on: the strip gets an orange bar in W/m2 and the through-flow line names the watts carried out by the air. The pictures are the evidence (drawn text and colour); the finished run is checked.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-vents-four-grilles.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 170
expect_not "Locked while the run goes"
click_text "Heat flow"
wait 20
shot 01-heat-flow-key
check_layout
check_blank 01-heat-flow-key
